<title>UK: EIB sets 34.8 billion peseta six-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 34.8 billion peseta six-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT  **34.8 BLN	COUPON   * NONE	MATURITY    **</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** SIX EQUAL TRANCHES OF 5.8 BILLION PESETAS</p>
<p>		MATURING ON 24.MAR.00, 27.MAR.00, 28.MAR.00,</p>
<p>		29.MAR.00, 30.MAR.00 AND 31.MAR.00 RESPECTIVELY.</p>
<p>	    * REDEMPTION AT PAR PLUS 94.252874 PCT OF THE INCREASE</p>
<p>		IN THE IBEX-35.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
